title: autotesteR
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: Cardoso Garcia
    given-names: Luiz Fernando
    affiliation: Universidade Federal do Paraná

version: 0.0.1
date-released: 2025-10-21

abstract: >
  Designed to streamline RNA-seq data analysis, this package provides tools
  for data import, validation, normalization, quality control, exploratory
  analysis, differential expression, enrichment, and visualization. It is
  optimized for pairwise group comparisons but can be extended to more
  complex experimental designs.


